---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { storeConfig } from "../data/store";
---
<SiteLayout title="Website Use & License | Eshwar Home Products" description="Usage notice for the Eshwar Home Products website, text, branding and product imagery.">
  <article class="legal-page">
    <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: 28 November 2026</p>
    <h1>Website Use &amp; License</h1>
    <p>This page explains the permitted use of the Eshwar Home Products website. It is a website content notice, not an open-source software licence for the underlying website code.</p>

    <h2>Website content</h2>
    <p>Unless a page or asset says otherwise, the website's original text, page layouts, graphics and store-created materials are reserved to {storeConfig.name} or their respective rights holders. You may view and share links to public pages for personal, non-commercial reference.</p>

    <h2>Product names, brands and images</h2>
    <p>Product names, trademarks, logos and third-party product imagery remain the property of their respective owners. Their appearance on this catalogue does not imply ownership by or endorsement of {storeConfig.name}. Product availability and details should be confirmed with the store.</p>

    <h2>Not permitted</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Copying or republishing substantial website content or imagery for commercial use without permission.</li>
      <li>Removing copyright, trademark or attribution notices.</li>
      <li>Using the website in a way that disrupts its operation or violates applicable law.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Open-source software</h2>
    <p>The website may use third-party open-source packages. Those packages remain subject to their own licence terms and notices. This page does not replace or override those licences.</p>

    <h2>Permission and contact</h2>
    <p>For permission to reuse original website materials, contact <a href={storeConfig.emailHref}>{storeConfig.email}</a>.</p>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
